            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# KITKAT 0.7.0

- Developer ID signed and Apple notarized.
- Native PIX-7 storage explorer with interactive rings, largest files, folder navigation and Finder reveal.
- Explicit, cancellable metadata scans with coverage warnings; no background disk indexing or automatic cleanup.
- Sirius imports and vault synchronization are user-driven, without periodic polling.
- Includes account recovery, capture and local document-conversion reliability improvements.

Build 13 · macOS 15 or later · Apple silicon
]]></description>
